  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-inbox-paste",
      "text": "[中文文档](README.zh.md)\n\nDSH **web bundle**: paste or pick files in the composer, store under `{session.cwd}/inbox/`, show thumbnails before/after send. Agents use `list_inbox` / `read_inbox` for **text**; **image understanding requires your own vision skill or model** (see below)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Requirements",
      "text": "- [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-Harness) with the **web** profile\n- Node.js ≥ 22, `dsh` CLI"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:JarszmLovesAI/dsh_upload_file\ndsh web\n```\n\nRemove: `dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-inbox-paste`"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "1. **Paste** (Ctrl+V / Cmd+V) or use the **paperclip** in the composer.\n2. Pending thumbnails appear above the input; remove with × before send (no disk write yet).\n3. On send, files land in `inbox/`; the bubble can show thumbnails (see config).\n4. Agent: `list_inbox` → `read_inbox` for text; for **images**, use the bundled [image-reader](skills/image-reader/README.md) skill or your own vision tooling."
    },
    {
      "section": "Upload ≠ multimodal understanding",
      "text": "This plugin does **not** use Harness native image attachments. The main model only gets path markers unless you add vision:\n\n- Install the optional **image-reader** skill and set `ARK_API_KEY` in `~/.dsh/.env`, or\n- Bring your own vision MCP / skill / multimodal model."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "`~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` (adjust profile name):\n\n```yaml\n- id: inbox-paste\n  config:\n    uploadMaxBytes: 26214400\n    inboxDirName: inbox\n\nRestart `dsh web` after changes."
    },
    {
      "section": "vs `dsh-file-upload`",
      "text": "| | dsh-inbox-paste | dsh-file-upload |\n|--|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Paste | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Storage | `{cwd}/inbox/` | `{cwd}/.dsh-uploads/` |\n| Built-in PDF | ❌ | ✅ |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
